{
  "$description": "Mari design tokens v2 — single source of truth for the prototype (design/prototype.html) and the Flutter theme (lib/core/theme/tokens.dart). Change a value here, then mirror it there.",
  "palette_story": "Kariba teal (calm lake blue-green) carries the brand and every action. Msasa amber is the warm second voice, saved for moments worth a smile. Grounds are a soft mist with a green-grey bias, never stark white or cream. Money in reads teal, money out over a limit reads copper, which colour-blind people tell apart better than green and red.",
